#: kmainwidget.cpp:440
msgid ""
"<b>Resume</b> button starts selected transfers\n"
"and sets their mode to <i>queued</i>."
msgstr ""
"<b>續傳</b>按鈕開始所選擇的檔案傳輸\n"
"並設定它們的模式至<i>已佇列</i>。"

#: kmainwidget.cpp:443
msgid ""
"<b>Pause</b> button stops selected transfers\n"
"and sets their mode to <i>delayed</i>."
msgstr ""
"<b>暫停</b>按鈕停止所選擇的檔案傳輸\n"
"並設定它們的模式至 <i>已延遲</i>。"

#: kmainwidget.cpp:446
msgid ""
"<b>Delete</b> button removes selected transfers\n"
"from the list."
msgstr "<b>刪除</b>按鈕從列表移除所選擇的檔案傳輸。"

#: kmainwidget.cpp:449
msgid ""
"<b>Restart</b> button is a convenience button\n"
"that simply does Pause and Resume."
msgstr "<b>重新開始</b>按鈕讓您方便的暫停或恢復傳輸。"

#: kmainwidget.cpp:452
msgid ""
"<b>Queued</b> button sets the mode of selected\n"
"transfers to <i>queued</i>.\n"
"\n"
"It is a radio button -- you can choose between\n"
"three modes."
msgstr ""
"<b>已佇列</b>按鈕將所選擇的檔案傳輸模式設定為<i>已佇列</i>。\n"
"\n"
"它是個單選按鈕——你可以在三種模式中選擇一種。"

#: kmainwidget.cpp:455
msgid ""
"<b>Scheduled</b> button sets the mode of selected\n"
"transfers to <i>scheduled</i>.\n"
"\n"
"It is a radio button -- you can choose between\n"
"three modes."
msgstr ""
"<b>已排程</b>按鈕將所選擇的檔案傳輸模式設定為<i>已排程</i>。\n"
"\n"
"它是一個單選按鈕——你可以在三種模式中選擇一種。"

#: kmainwidget.cpp:458
msgid ""
"<b>Delayed</b> button sets the mode of selected\n"
"transfers to <i>delayed</i>.This also causes the selected transfers to stop.\n"
"\n"
"It is a radio button -- you can choose between\n"
"three modes."
msgstr ""
"<b>已延遲</b>按鈕將所選擇的檔案傳輸\n"
"模式設定為<i>已延遲</i>。它也會令所選擇的檔案\n"
"停止傳輸。\n"
"\n"
"它是一個單選按鈕——你可以在三種模式中選擇一種。"

#: kmainwidget.cpp:461
msgid ""
"<b>Preferences</b> button opens a preferences dialog\n"
"where you can set various options.\n"
"\n"
"Some of these options can be more easily set using the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"<b>偏好設定</b>按鈕開啟偏好設定對話框，讓您設定多種選項。\n"
"\n"
"使用這工具列令您某容易些設定某些選項。"

#: kmainwidget.cpp:464
msgid ""
"<b>Log window</b> button opens a log window.\n"
"The log window records all program events that occur\n"
"while KGet is running."
msgstr ""
"<b>記錄視窗</b>按鈕開啟記錄視窗。\n"
"記錄視窗記錄所有 KGet 執行時發生的程式事件。"

#: kmainwidget.cpp:467
msgid ""
"<b>Paste transfer</b> button adds a URL from\n"
"the clipboard as a new transfer.\n"
"\n"
"This way you can easily copy&paste URLs between\n"
"applications."
msgstr ""
"<b>貼上傳輸</b>按鈕會自剪貼簿增加一個 URL 為新的傳輸。\n"
"\n"
"這個方法讓您在應用程式之間容易地複製和貼上 URL 。"

#: kmainwidget.cpp:470
msgid ""
"<b>Expert mode</b> button toggles the expert mode\n"
"on and off.\n"
"\n"
"Expert mode is recommended for experienced users.\n"
"When set, you will not be \"bothered\" by confirmation\n"
"messages.\n"
"<b>Important!</b>\n"
"Turn it on if you are using auto-disconnect or\n"
"auto-shutdown features and you want KGet to disconnect \n"
"or shut down without asking."
msgstr ""
"<b>專家模式</b>按鈕會啟動或關閉專家模式；\n"
"按一下啟動，再按則停止。\n"
"\n"
"專家模式供熟練使用者使用。\n"
"當啟動了專家模式，您將不會被確定訊息「打擾」。\n"
"<b>重要事項！</b>\n"
"如果您使用自動斷線或自動關閉功能，\n"
"並且您想要 KGet 斷線或關閉而不而事先詢問，請啟動它。"

#: kmainwidget.cpp:473
msgid ""
"<b>Use last folder</b> button toggles the\n"
"use-last-folder feature on and off.\n"
"\n"
"When set, KGet will ignore the folder settings\n"
"and put all new added transfers into the folder\n"
"where the last transfer was put."
msgstr ""
"<b>使用最近資料夾</b>按鈕會啟動或關閉「使用最近資料夾」\n"
"模式；按一下啟動，再按則停止。\n"
"\n"
"當啟動了這項功能， KGet 將會忽略目錄設定值\n"
"並且將所有新增的傳輸檔案放置到最近一次傳輸所放置的目錄。"

#: kmainwidget.cpp:476
msgid ""
"<b>Auto disconnect</b> button toggles the auto-disconnect\n"
"mode on and off.\n"
"\n"
"When set, KGet will disconnect automatically\n"
"after all queued transfers are finished.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Important!</b>\n"
"Also turn on the expert mode when you want KGet\n"
"to disconnect without asking."
msgstr ""
"<b>自動斷線</b>按鈕會啟動或關閉自動斷線\n"
"模式；按一下啟動，再按則停止。\n"
"\n"
"當啟動了這項功能， KGet 將會在所有已佇列傳輸完成後\n"
"自動斷線。\n"
"\n"
"<b>重要事項！</b>\n"
"如您希望 KGet 斷線而不要事先詢問您，請同時啟動\n"
"專家模式。"

#: kmainwidget.cpp:479
msgid ""
"<b>Auto shutdown</b> button toggles the auto-shutdown\n"
"mode on and off.\n"
"\n"
"When set, KGet will quit automatically\n"
"after all queued transfers are finished.\n"
"<b>Important!</b>\n"
"Also turn on the expert mode when you want KGet\n"
"to quit without asking."
msgstr ""
"<b>自動關閉</b>按鈕會啟動或關閉自動關閉\n"
"模式；按一下啟動，再按則停止。\n"
"\n"
"當啟動了這項功能， KGet 將會在所有已佇列\n"
"傳輸完成後自動關閉。\n"
"\n"
"<b>重要事項！</b>\n"
"如您希望 KGet 關閉而不要事先詢問您，請同時開啟\n"
"專家模式。"

#: kmainwidget.cpp:482
msgid ""
"<b>Offline mode</b> button toggles the offline mode\n"
"on and off.\n"
"\n"
"When set, KGet will act as if it was not connected\n"
"to the Internet.\n"
"\n"
"You can browse offline, while still being able to add\n"
"new transfers as queued."
msgstr ""
"<b>離線模式</b>按鈕會啟動或關閉離線模式\n"
"模式；按一下啟動，再按則停止。\n"
"\n"
"當啟動了這項功能， KGet 將會扮作沒有連結到\n"
"互聯網。\n"
"\n"
"您可以離線瀏覽，並且仍然可以新增傳輸到佇列中。"

#: kmainwidget.cpp:485
msgid ""
"<b>Auto paste</b> button toggles the auto-paste mode\n"
"on and off.\n"
"\n"
"When set, KGet will periodically scan the clipboard\n"
"for URLs and paste them automatically."
msgstr ""
"<b>自動貼上</b>按鈕會啟動或關閉自動貼上離線\n"
"模式；按一下啟動，再按則停止。\n"
"\n"
"當啟動了這項功能， KGet 將會週期性地掃描剪貼簿上的\n"
"URL 並且自動地貼上這些 URL 。"

#: kmainwidget.cpp:488
msgid ""
"<b>Drop target</b> button toggles the window style\n"
"between a normal window and a drop target.\n"
"\n"
"When set, the main window will be hidden and\n"
"instead a small shaped window will appear.\n"
"\n"
"You can show/hide a normal window with a simple click\n"
"on a shaped window."
msgstr ""
"<b>拖放目標</b>按鈕會於一般視窗及拖放目標兩個\n"
"視窗風格間切換。\n"
"\n"
"開啟後，主視窗將會隱藏而一個小的成形視窗將會出現。\n"
"\n"
"你可以簡單地敲擊成形視窗以顯示或隱藏一般視窗。"

